NOTE ON THE DATA
----------------
This licence covers the code and documentation in this repository only.

The scientific dataset this project analyses is NOT covered by it and is NOT
redistributed here. It is downloaded at run time from its original archive:

  Emmenegger, B., Massoni, J., Pestalozzi, C. M., Bortfeld-Miller, M.,
  Maier, B. A., & Vorholt, J. A. (2023). Code and data repository for
  "Identifying microbiota community patterns important for plant protection
  using synthetic communities and machine learning". Zenodo.
  https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10118600

That dataset is licensed CC-BY 4.0 and remains the work of its authors, who
must be credited in any reuse.
